WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.492 --> 00:00:20.884
First, what your sheet needs to look like.

2
00:00:20.884 --> 00:00:26.888
Three columns: Last name, First name, Phone.

3
00:00:26.888 --> 00:00:33.096
The phone column is optional — a blank cell is fine.

4
00:00:33.096 --> 00:00:44.599
One attendee per row. Save it as .csv or .xlsx.

5
00:00:44.599 --> 00:00:48.414
Everything an instructor does starts from the kiosk.

6
00:00:48.414 --> 00:00:55.814
Tap Management, in the row under the two big buttons.

7
00:00:55.814 --> 00:00:59.000
The panel is behind your instructor PIN.

8
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:03.224
Face ID is the shortcut — the PIN is what actually opens it.

9
00:01:03.224 --> 00:01:08.897
Type your PIN.

10
00:01:08.897 --> 00:01:14.381
Then tap Unlock.

11
00:01:14.381 --> 00:01:20.126
This is the Instructor Panel: Records, Add New and Export.

12
00:01:20.126 --> 00:01:26.082
Open the Add New tab.

13
00:01:26.082 --> 00:01:32.607
The upload is under the table: Or Upload a Name Sheet.

14
00:01:32.607 --> 00:01:39.032
Existing attendees are matched and merged, never duplicated.

15
00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:45.959
Tap Choose File and pick your sheet.

16
00:01:45.959 --> 00:01:53.867
The summary says what was added and what was already there.
